 indiNatan BadalovDerrell MeyersOriginally from Buffalo\, New York\, Malachi
  Fox is a comedian\, producer\, and the founder of No Cent Comedy\, an inde
 pendent comedy showcase dedicated to creating unforgettable live comedy exp
 eriences while spotlighting both rising talent and established performers.A
 s the creator of No Cent Comedy\, Malachi has produced successful showcases
  in Buffalo\, New York\, and North Carolina\, with the brand continuing to 
 expand into new markets across the country. His productions are built on st
 rong lineups\, high-energy entertainment\, and a commitment to creating opp
 ortunities for comedians while delivering memorable experiences for audienc
 es.As a performer\, Malachi has appeared on stages throughout the East Coas
 t and West Coast\, performing in numerous comedy clubs across New York City
  and beyond. He has also been featured in the Comedy Mob Festival and the B
 altimore Comedy Festival\, continuing to build a reputation as both a dynam
 ic comic and a respected independent producer.Whether he’s behind the sce
 nes producing shows or on stage behind the microphone\, Malachi’s mission
  remains the same: to build community through comedy\, create opportunities
  for comedians\, and bring people together through unforgettable nights of 
 laughter.Joe Mahoney is an NYC comic from Long Island who can play to many 
 different crowds. His clever writing has earned him countless spots at the 
 legendary Comic Strip Live and feature work on the road. He’s appeared on
